WEBVTT

1
00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:31.041
{\an8}LOWER SILESIA, 1957

2
00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:03.833
O Lord,

3
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:06.666
show us thy grace

4
00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:09.375
and destroy this evil seed

5
00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:11.916
forever and ever.

6
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:27.875
I'm sorry.

7
00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:39.000
Drop it! Police!

8
00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:41.416
Drop it, I said!

9
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:45.250
Step away from the baby or I'll shoot!

10
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:47.500
Oh my God. You don't understand anything.

11
00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:49.416
Drop the knife!

12
00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:35.916
{\an8}30 YEARS LATER

13
00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:48.125
- Praised be Jesus Christ.
- Forever and ever, amen.

14
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:51.208
- I'm Father Marek.
- I know. We've been expecting you.

15
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:53.083
Come in, please.

16
00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:16.541
I'm really glad
you've been assigned here, Father.

17
00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:19.125
It's not easy to find an exorcist

18
00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:23.416
who would be willing to serve God

19
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.916
in such a remote place.

20
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.333
Even more so since we are
the only such sanatorium.

21
00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:29.375
Sanatorium?

22
00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:33.125
Indeed. That's what we like
to call ourselves.

23
00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:36.916
After all, we heal the tormented ones.

24
00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:43.833
Meet Brother Dawid,
our jack-of-all-trades.

25
00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.083
Praised be Jesus.

26
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.083
- A habit.
- God bless you.

27
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.000
A rosary.

28
00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.958
I have my own, if that's not a problem.

29
00:05:08.291 --> 00:05:11.333
And we will also need
to search your belongings.

30
00:05:15.125 --> 00:05:16.125
Of course.

31
00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:22.625
It's a standard procedure
for all newcomers and visitors alike.

32
00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:23.791
You do understand?

33
00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:27.458
It's to ensure
that nothing is brought in here

34
00:05:27.541 --> 00:05:30.250
that could disturb
the harmony of our life.

35
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.500
Do you have many visitors, then?

36
00:05:35.125 --> 00:05:37.875
Visits are allowed
once a year, at Christmas.

37
00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:40.375
But truth be told, hardly anyone comes.

38
00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:43.291
You know, Father...

39
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:46.833
The world would gladly forget
about the tormented ones.

40
00:05:47.625 --> 00:05:50.791
They usually don't have any family,

41
00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:52.833
which makes them most vulnerable.

42
00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:56.083
Cigarettes.

43
00:05:58.125 --> 00:06:00.791
I'm afraid we'll have to confiscate these.

44
00:06:12.333 --> 00:06:16.791
We don't have electricity or a phone line,
but you'll be comfortable here.

45
00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:18.958
The bathroom's over there.

46
00:06:19.791 --> 00:06:21.500
Oh, one more thing.

47
00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.500
We normally don't go out after dark.

48
00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:27.750
Everyone should stay in their cells.

49
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:31.583
Thank you. I think I know everything now.

50
00:06:36.083 --> 00:06:38.041
It's good to have you with us.

51
00:06:38.833 --> 00:06:43.000
Here, the Evil One
often manifests his presence.

52
00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.291
In fact, all the time.

53
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:47.708
It won't be easy, but...

54
00:06:49.416 --> 00:06:52.416
I have a feeling
that this is your calling, Father.

55
00:06:54.416 --> 00:06:57.083
Well, I believe I'm here for a reason.

56
00:07:01.166 --> 00:07:02.166
That's right.

57
00:08:08.416 --> 00:08:11.208
{\an8}ANOTHER WOMAN GOES MISSING

58
00:08:11.291 --> 00:08:14.791
{\an8}EIGHT WOMEN DISAPPEARED
IN SOUTHERN POLAND

59
00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:16.750
O almighty Lord,

60
00:08:17.375 --> 00:08:22.708
your Son promised his disciples,
who united in his name,

61
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:24.666
to remain amongst them.

62
00:08:26.416 --> 00:08:31.125
Bless us and the food we are about to eat.

63
00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:36.875
Show us your grace
by supporting our monastic family

64
00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:41.041
on our daily journey toward your life.

65
00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:45.416
In the name of the Father, the Son,
and the Holy Spirit. Amen.

66
00:09:50.708 --> 00:09:51.708
Eat it.

67
00:11:20.416 --> 00:11:24.041
Do you know how much time passed
between Judas's betrayal

68
00:11:24.125 --> 00:11:28.208
and Peter's third denial of Jesus, Father?

69
00:11:30.708 --> 00:11:31.708
Six hours.

70
00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.208
That's why the time of exorcisms
is so important to us.

71
00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.916
Satan has mocked the Creator so many times

72
00:11:46.208 --> 00:11:48.208
that you need to get to know him well.

73
00:11:48.791 --> 00:11:50.916
Know when he is at his weakest.

74
00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.041
At 6:00 a.m.

75
00:11:53.125 --> 00:11:55.916
At this time Peter denied Jesus,

76
00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:59.958
and Satan thought that he'd defeated God.

77
00:12:00.041 --> 00:12:01.041
Exactly.

78
00:12:08.291 --> 00:12:11.833
We are recording all the exorcisms
so we don't miss anything.

79
00:12:12.791 --> 00:12:15.958
Some cases are very complicated.

80
00:12:16.791 --> 00:12:18.875
Sometimes it even happens that...

81
00:12:22.458 --> 00:12:23.458
Things happen.

82
00:13:37.791 --> 00:13:39.500
Everything will be all right.

83
00:13:40.125 --> 00:13:41.166
We'll help you.

84
00:13:52.291 --> 00:13:55.625
In the name of the Father, the Son,
and the Holy Spirit. Amen.

85
00:14:12.541 --> 00:14:16.916
I command you, Satan,
to depart from this innocent soul.

86
00:14:41.583 --> 00:14:45.958
In the name of the Father, the Son,
and the Holy Spirit. Amen.

87
00:14:49.875 --> 00:14:52.166
Holy Michael, the Archangel,

88
00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.375
defend us in battle.

89
00:14:54.458 --> 00:14:59.375
Be our safeguard against the wickedness
and snares of the Devil.

90
00:14:59.458 --> 00:15:03.666
May God rebuke him, we humbly pray,

91
00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.875
and do you, O Prince of the heavenly host,

92
00:15:06.958 --> 00:15:10.375
cast Satan and all evil spirits

93
00:15:10.458 --> 00:15:14.708
who wander through the world
seeking the ruin of souls

94
00:15:14.791 --> 00:15:18.708
into hell by the power of God.

95
00:15:20.291 --> 00:15:21.958
Holy Michael, the Archangel,

96
00:15:22.041 --> 00:15:23.958
defend us in battle.

97
00:15:24.041 --> 00:15:29.166
Be our safeguard against the wickedness
and snares of the Devil.

98
00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.875
May God rebuke him, we humbly pray,

99
00:15:33.958 --> 00:15:37.416
and do you, O Prince of the heavenly host,

100
00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:41.083
cast Satan and all evil spirits

101
00:15:41.166 --> 00:15:45.000
who wander through the world
seeking the ruin of souls

102
00:15:45.083 --> 00:15:50.125
into hell by the power of God.

103
00:16:47.333 --> 00:16:48.166
The crucifix!

104
00:16:50.625 --> 00:16:52.833
Holy Michael, the Archangel,

105
00:16:52.916 --> 00:16:54.708
defend us in battle.

106
00:16:54.791 --> 00:16:59.333
Be our safeguard against the wickedness
and snares of the Devil.

107
00:17:05.875 --> 00:17:09.375
May God rebuke him, we humbly pray,

108
00:17:09.458 --> 00:17:12.416
and do you, O Prince of the heavenly host,

109
00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:15.375
cast Satan and all evil spirits

110
00:17:15.458 --> 00:17:20.333
who wander through the world
seeking the ruin of souls

111
00:17:20.416 --> 00:17:22.583
into hell by the power of God.

112
00:19:11.875 --> 00:19:13.791
May I help you, Father?

113
00:19:15.833 --> 00:19:16.833
What's in there?

114
00:19:17.791 --> 00:19:19.166
The Prior's office.

115
00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.083
You're only allowed inside
if you're invited.

116
00:19:27.333 --> 00:19:28.333
Sure.

117
00:25:47.333 --> 00:25:48.416
Fuck.

118
00:27:44.833 --> 00:27:48.208
Grace and peace from him, who is,

119
00:27:48.291 --> 00:27:51.458
who was, and who is still to come

120
00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:55.125
be with you all.

121
00:27:55.916 --> 00:28:00.125
Now and forever and unto the ages of ages.

122
00:28:01.083 --> 00:28:03.958
Amen.

123
00:28:07.708 --> 00:28:10.250
Today, the penitential act will be led by...

124
00:28:12.333 --> 00:28:13.333
Brother Marek.

125
00:28:50.416 --> 00:28:51.375
Brethren...

126
00:28:53.833 --> 00:28:55.291
let us acknowledge our sins

127
00:28:55.375 --> 00:28:58.833
and so prepare ourselves
to celebrate the sacred mysteries...

128
00:28:58.916 --> 00:29:00.666
In Latin, please.

129
00:29:41.000 --> 00:29:42.000
That's enough.

130
00:29:46.041 --> 00:29:47.750
Brother Piotr will take over.

131
00:30:04.000 --> 00:30:07.500
Brethren, let us acknowledge our sins,

132
00:30:07.583 --> 00:30:10.833
and so prepare ourselves
to celebrate the sacred mysteries.

133
00:30:10.916 --> 00:30:13.750
I confess to almighty God

134
00:30:13.833 --> 00:30:15.916
and to you, my brothers,

135
00:30:16.000 --> 00:30:18.750
that I have greatly sinned,
in my thoughts,

136
00:30:18.833 --> 00:30:22.000
and in my words, in what I have done,
and in what I have failed to do.

137
00:30:23.708 --> 00:30:24.833
Through my fault,

138
00:30:26.541 --> 00:30:27.708
through my fault,

139
00:30:29.541 --> 00:30:31.375
through my most grievous fault.

140
00:33:57.791 --> 00:34:01.666
Marek, go to the church
and wait for me in a confessional.

141
00:34:25.291 --> 00:34:27.250
They're watching your every step.

142
00:34:27.333 --> 00:34:29.833
They know you're looking for something.

143
00:34:29.916 --> 00:34:31.208
You're playing with fire.

144
00:34:31.291 --> 00:34:34.833
Any act of disobedience
is met with a brutal punishment.

145
00:34:36.041 --> 00:34:39.875
I learned this the hard way
when I tried to escape and was caught.

146
00:34:40.750 --> 00:34:43.333
There's no way out. It's a one-way ticket.

147
00:34:44.125 --> 00:34:46.833
Obey, keep a low profile,
don't snoop around.

148
00:34:46.916 --> 00:34:49.041
And no questions or you're finished.

149
00:34:49.875 --> 00:34:51.666
This is no ordinary monastery.

150
00:34:58.583 --> 00:35:00.291
I had to warn you.

151
00:35:02.833 --> 00:35:06.416
Gotta go. If someone saw me
here with you, that would be it.

152
00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:08.333
Wait.

153
00:35:14.708 --> 00:35:16.208
I'm not a priest.

154
00:35:18.041 --> 00:35:19.250
I'm a police officer.

155
00:35:20.708 --> 00:35:23.583
- What?
- Eight women went missing in the area.

156
00:35:24.458 --> 00:35:26.666
We received an anonymous tip that

157
00:35:27.625 --> 00:35:31.250
they were admitted here
as they were possessed but never left.

158
00:35:33.791 --> 00:35:36.666
Police can't run a normal investigation.

159
00:35:36.750 --> 00:35:40.875
After Father Popiełuszko's murder
they won't meddle with Church affairs,

160
00:35:41.583 --> 00:35:43.416
so they sent me here undercover.

161
00:35:48.916 --> 00:35:50.583
I saw the recordings.

162
00:35:50.666 --> 00:35:54.583
All these possessions and exorcisms
are a scam, right?

163
00:35:56.958 --> 00:35:57.958
Yeah.

164
00:35:59.500 --> 00:36:02.125
The Prior stages it all
using various tricks.

165
00:36:02.791 --> 00:36:05.333
To milk the Curia
and the Vatican for money.

166
00:36:05.416 --> 00:36:08.541
New possessions are good for business.
Obviously.

167
00:36:08.625 --> 00:36:11.000
He has proof that these women went insane

168
00:36:11.083 --> 00:36:12.750
and died during exorcisms.

169
00:36:13.916 --> 00:36:16.000
What does he do to them exactly?

170
00:36:17.333 --> 00:36:18.333
I don't know.

171
00:36:21.083 --> 00:36:22.416
Maybe they're drugged.

172
00:36:24.083 --> 00:36:26.958
You saw what happened

173
00:36:27.041 --> 00:36:29.291
to the last girl they exorcised.

174
00:36:30.083 --> 00:36:33.541
They bury them
in the little graveyard in the courtyard.

175
00:36:40.166 --> 00:36:41.583
Will you get us out?

176
00:36:44.833 --> 00:36:45.833
I will.

177
00:36:47.625 --> 00:36:48.625
When?

178
00:36:54.500 --> 00:36:56.333
When I finish what I started here.

179
00:37:03.166 --> 00:37:04.625
Just be careful.

180
00:37:06.041 --> 00:37:07.500
They can see everything.

181
00:44:16.250 --> 00:44:17.250
And now what?

182
00:44:20.000 --> 00:44:21.000
Huh?

183
00:44:34.250 --> 00:44:35.250
Fuck...

184
00:45:12.541 --> 00:45:16.875
I was hoping
we'd work together harmoniously.

185
00:45:16.958 --> 00:45:21.500
But regrettably, I have to say
I'm disappointed in you, Father.

186
00:45:24.916 --> 00:45:28.875
Never mind. I hope you're hungry.

187
00:45:31.583 --> 00:45:35.833
In the name of the Father, the Son,
and the Holy Spirit. Amen.

188
00:46:17.166 --> 00:46:18.625
What the fuck do you want?

189
00:46:54.500 --> 00:46:56.708
There's no point in resisting.

190
00:46:57.583 --> 00:46:59.416
You will eat it all anyway, Father.

191
00:46:59.500 --> 00:47:01.625
All four portions.

192
00:47:02.333 --> 00:47:03.541
Why?

193
00:47:04.833 --> 00:47:06.750
It's medicinal.

194
00:51:16.333 --> 00:51:17.333
It's me.

195
00:51:18.583 --> 00:51:19.916
Easy, it's only me.

196
00:51:21.333 --> 00:51:23.291
Jesus, what have they done to you?

197
00:51:32.666 --> 00:51:33.875
Dear Lord...

198
00:51:38.083 --> 00:51:39.708
They've really done it.

199
00:51:42.083 --> 00:51:44.083
I'm getting the fuck out of here.

200
00:51:45.333 --> 00:51:46.416
Wait.

201
00:51:47.000 --> 00:51:48.000
Wait.

202
00:51:50.375 --> 00:51:53.125
There's something I need to show you.

203
00:51:53.208 --> 00:51:56.041
- I've seen enough now.
- But not everything.

204
00:51:59.666 --> 00:52:01.000
I found something.

205
00:52:02.583 --> 00:52:05.125
Something to do with you.

206
00:52:08.583 --> 00:52:10.500
And this. You have to see it.

207
00:52:12.666 --> 00:52:13.666
Please.

208
00:52:35.250 --> 00:52:36.250
Have a look here.

209
00:52:44.625 --> 00:52:47.375
"The eclipse marks
the birth of the Chosen One."

210
00:52:57.458 --> 00:53:01.375
"He has to be slain upon his birth."

211
00:53:01.458 --> 00:53:03.458
There's a description of the ritual.

212
00:53:03.541 --> 00:53:04.708
A dagger.

213
00:53:05.583 --> 00:53:06.583
And a prayer.

214
00:53:09.958 --> 00:53:11.750
"If he isn't slain..."

215
00:53:12.708 --> 00:53:13.916
Here.

216
00:53:14.000 --> 00:53:16.166
"...the Chosen One
shall devour seven sinners

217
00:53:16.250 --> 00:53:17.833
and drink the blood of an innocent one."

218
00:53:22.791 --> 00:53:23.791
And then...

219
00:53:31.750 --> 00:53:33.500
"Once the ritual is complete,

220
00:53:34.500 --> 00:53:39.416
the Chosen One will transform into a demon
and the world will cease to be."

221
00:53:43.583 --> 00:53:44.583
Do you get it?

222
00:53:46.625 --> 00:53:48.875
They think you're the Chosen One.

223
00:53:50.958 --> 00:53:52.583
They're completing the ritual.

224
00:53:59.625 --> 00:54:00.750
What is this book?

225
00:54:03.125 --> 00:54:04.750
It's at least 1,000 years old.

226
00:54:17.208 --> 00:54:18.666
You recognize this symbol.

227
00:54:19.875 --> 00:54:22.958
I knew it. It all falls into place.

228
00:54:27.500 --> 00:54:29.333
I'm a police officer, not a...

229
00:54:29.958 --> 00:54:33.000
dragon from some folk fairy tale!

230
00:54:33.083 --> 00:54:34.166
I know that.

231
00:54:34.250 --> 00:54:36.791
But they're fanatics.
They can't be reasoned with.

232
00:54:37.875 --> 00:54:39.291
They killed these women.

233
00:54:40.000 --> 00:54:41.625
And they will kill us.

234
00:54:43.708 --> 00:54:45.458
Now you know everything.

235
00:54:55.125 --> 00:54:56.250
I know how to escape.

236
00:54:58.000 --> 00:55:00.208
There's a hidden underground passage.

237
00:55:00.916 --> 00:55:01.750
Come.

238
00:55:02.750 --> 00:55:04.125
An underground passage?

239
00:55:06.000 --> 00:55:08.125
A tunnel leading outside the premises.

240
00:55:09.166 --> 00:55:10.166
Come on.

241
00:55:14.708 --> 00:55:18.000
I was going to use it
that time they caught me.

242
00:55:22.041 --> 00:55:23.500
Look what they did to me.

243
00:55:41.875 --> 00:55:42.958
Trust me.

244
00:55:43.791 --> 00:55:45.458
And let's get out of here.

245
00:55:49.708 --> 00:55:50.666
Lead the way.

246
00:56:13.416 --> 00:56:14.500
Shine the flashlight.

247
00:56:45.000 --> 00:56:47.416
I planned it pretty well back then.

248
00:58:12.458 --> 00:58:13.791
I fucking knew it.

249
00:58:37.750 --> 00:58:38.750
Marek.

250
00:58:40.000 --> 00:58:41.000
Marek!

251
00:58:46.291 --> 00:58:47.750
You almost got away.

252
00:58:48.416 --> 00:58:50.833
But in the end, I came out on top.

253
00:58:53.375 --> 00:58:54.291
You see,

254
00:58:55.791 --> 00:58:58.000
it's no accident you're here.

255
00:58:58.708 --> 00:59:00.500
It was my doing.

256
00:59:02.375 --> 00:59:04.708
A few anonymous tips, a couple of bribes,

257
00:59:04.791 --> 00:59:07.458
and you were assigned
the missing women case.

258
00:59:08.291 --> 00:59:11.500
I'm sorry we played you,
but we had no choice.

259
00:59:12.666 --> 00:59:17.041
You wouldn't participate in this
willingly, would you?

260
00:59:18.375 --> 00:59:22.208
You, a police officer,

261
00:59:22.291 --> 00:59:26.125
would never believe our good intentions.

262
00:59:28.500 --> 00:59:31.208
Maybe you can't see it straightaway,

263
00:59:31.291 --> 00:59:33.416
but we really mean well.

264
00:59:42.875 --> 00:59:45.791
God and the Devil sit side by side.

265
00:59:46.666 --> 00:59:48.083
They have an understanding.

266
00:59:48.708 --> 00:59:49.625
Always have.

267
00:59:50.166 --> 00:59:51.375
Since the beginning.

268
00:59:52.416 --> 00:59:54.291
But the Devil is not evil.

269
00:59:54.375 --> 00:59:55.583
People are.

270
00:59:56.291 --> 00:59:58.375
They deserve to be punished.

271
01:00:04.500 --> 01:00:06.041
And they shall be punished.

272
01:00:10.333 --> 01:00:12.541
This well is a gateway to hell.

273
01:00:13.125 --> 01:00:15.541
This is why our monastery was built here.

274
01:00:16.250 --> 01:00:19.416
For 800 years,
our order's been waiting for this moment.

275
01:00:19.916 --> 01:00:21.041
Waiting for you.

276
01:00:26.500 --> 01:00:29.916
Once the ritual is complete,
the Evil One will enter your body.

277
01:00:30.416 --> 01:00:34.875
A new order will prevail on earth
under his rule.

278
01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:40.125
We will be his disciples.

279
01:00:40.750 --> 01:00:43.750
We will rule this new, better world.

280
01:00:44.458 --> 01:00:48.166
There's only one piece missing now.

281
01:00:52.500 --> 01:00:53.958
The blood of an innocent one.

282
01:01:43.166 --> 01:01:45.083
Let her go, you fucker!

283
01:01:46.041 --> 01:01:47.041
No!

284
01:01:57.208 --> 01:01:58.208
No!

285
01:02:51.708 --> 01:02:53.000
This is the moment.

286
01:02:54.250 --> 01:02:56.416
The most important moment in history.

287
01:03:12.083 --> 01:03:16.625
...and forgive us our debts,
as we forgive our debtors.

288
01:03:16.708 --> 01:03:18.333
And lead us not into temptation,

289
01:03:18.916 --> 01:03:20.791
but deliver us from evil. Amen.

290
01:03:21.500 --> 01:03:23.583
Hail Mary, full of grace...

291
01:03:52.666 --> 01:03:55.291
Come to us, Lord.

292
01:04:34.750 --> 01:04:36.166
Come to us, Lord?

293
01:04:37.250 --> 01:04:38.541
Come to us, Lord.

294
01:05:03.166 --> 01:05:04.625
Have we missed anything?

295
01:05:05.833 --> 01:05:07.458
Perhaps we have.

296
01:05:09.125 --> 01:05:10.125
No.

297
01:05:11.416 --> 01:05:12.416
I don't know.

298
01:05:13.208 --> 01:05:14.375
I don't think so.

299
01:05:17.125 --> 01:05:20.958
It's not exactly a set of instructions,
just some notes

300
01:05:21.041 --> 01:05:22.250
from 800 years ago.

301
01:05:29.583 --> 01:05:33.791
Maybe he was meant to devour
the sinners whole, and we interpreted it...

302
01:05:35.291 --> 01:05:37.083
you know, more symbolically?

303
01:05:38.375 --> 01:05:39.416
Impossible.

304
01:05:40.208 --> 01:05:41.833
There were seven sinners.

305
01:05:41.916 --> 01:05:44.083
Each committed a specific sin.

306
01:05:44.166 --> 01:05:45.958
The eighth one was a virgin.

307
01:05:46.583 --> 01:05:48.333
He's the Chosen One.

308
01:05:48.416 --> 01:05:49.750
It all adds up.

309
01:05:56.708 --> 01:05:58.166
You said it would work.

310
01:06:01.625 --> 01:06:03.333
Are you blaming me?

311
01:06:06.958 --> 01:06:08.041
Well, no, I'm not.

312
01:06:14.291 --> 01:06:15.458
What do we do now?

313
01:06:26.500 --> 01:06:27.500
Brothers!

314
01:06:41.833 --> 01:06:42.833
Brothers...

315
01:06:45.708 --> 01:06:46.666
Perhaps...

316
01:06:50.375 --> 01:06:52.000
Perhaps, after all it was...

317
01:06:54.208 --> 01:06:55.708
most likely a mistake.

318
01:06:58.333 --> 01:06:59.625
So now what?

319
01:07:01.416 --> 01:07:03.250
Let's get back to our cells.

320
01:07:05.291 --> 01:07:08.375
We'll see you tomorrow as usual.

321
01:07:11.041 --> 01:07:12.250
We meant well.

322
01:07:13.416 --> 01:07:15.250
We're all in this together.

323
01:07:16.750 --> 01:07:18.000
Don't worry.

324
01:07:22.208 --> 01:07:25.125
Everything can be... explained.

325
01:07:25.208 --> 01:07:26.708
Except for him.

326
01:07:26.791 --> 01:07:28.875
They'll be looking for him.

327
01:07:44.708 --> 01:07:46.375
I'm sorry it's come to this.

328
01:08:25.333 --> 01:08:26.833
Antoni, untie him

329
01:08:27.708 --> 01:08:29.166
and throw him into the well.

330
01:09:02.875 --> 01:09:04.708
Get back to your cells.

331
01:10:25.333 --> 01:10:28.166
<i>Don't say a word
The party goes on</i>

332
01:10:32.916 --> 01:10:35.000
<i>The record's playing now</i>

333
01:10:35.750 --> 01:10:38.791
<i>A long-forgotten hit</i>

334
01:10:39.791 --> 01:10:42.291
<i>Give me tonight</i>

335
01:10:43.291 --> 01:10:45.666
<i>Only one night</i>

336
01:10:46.833 --> 01:10:49.208
<i>Give me tonight</i>

337
01:10:50.375 --> 01:10:52.625
<i>Only one night</i>

338
01:10:54.166 --> 01:10:57.125
<i>Worries sleep in cozy homes...</i>

339
01:10:57.208 --> 01:11:02.833
<i>Let the Lord be with us all</i>

340
01:11:03.500 --> 01:11:08.375
<i>Alleluia</i>

341
01:11:09.041 --> 01:11:13.625
<i>Let him come to our defense</i>

342
01:11:13.708 --> 01:11:15.208
Jesus Christ, Andrzej...

343
01:11:16.708 --> 01:11:18.416
I need to fix this.

344
01:11:19.166 --> 01:11:21.375
- We'll fix it tomorrow.
- We will?

345
01:11:22.833 --> 01:11:25.541
- All right. Up we go.
- What?

346
01:11:36.083 --> 01:11:37.333
Let's get you to bed.

347
01:11:53.708 --> 01:11:56.250
Oh, hi, Piotrek. Been here long?

348
01:11:59.541 --> 01:12:00.541
Since forever.

349
01:12:07.666 --> 01:12:08.916
Sit down, Piotrek.

350
01:12:09.583 --> 01:12:10.583
Sit down.

351
01:12:20.916 --> 01:12:22.250
You see, Piotrek?

352
01:12:24.083 --> 01:12:26.666
I was supposed to be the Devil's disciple,

353
01:12:27.791 --> 01:12:29.500
and fuck all happened.

354
01:12:30.666 --> 01:12:32.250
I know.

355
01:12:35.375 --> 01:12:37.916
But you are a super subprior.

356
01:12:38.750 --> 01:12:40.500
An awesome deputy.

357
01:12:48.833 --> 01:12:49.833
I know.

358
01:15:10.208 --> 01:15:11.625
Brother Antoni!

359
01:15:29.125 --> 01:15:30.500
What happened?

360
01:15:31.958 --> 01:15:34.791
I came to get him
'cause he hadn't come out,

361
01:15:34.875 --> 01:15:36.708
and I found him like this.

362
01:15:41.208 --> 01:15:42.208
Good Lord...

363
01:15:43.291 --> 01:15:45.458
I should have stayed with him last night.

364
01:15:50.625 --> 01:15:52.083
He was no youngster.

365
01:15:54.041 --> 01:15:55.375
Don't blame yourself.

366
01:15:58.000 --> 01:15:58.916
Come here.

367
01:16:03.750 --> 01:16:06.750
You will take over his duties.

368
01:16:09.125 --> 01:16:10.291
I know.

369
01:16:13.791 --> 01:16:15.541
Who will notify the Curia?

370
01:16:17.166 --> 01:16:18.208
I will.

371
01:18:25.958 --> 01:18:29.500
O Lord, hear our prayers
for our brother's soul.

372
01:18:30.083 --> 01:18:33.875
If it is still stained
by his earthly sins,

373
01:18:33.958 --> 01:18:37.000
let it be cleansed by your divine mercy.

374
01:18:37.625 --> 01:18:40.666
Through Christ, our Lord, amen.

375
01:18:41.916 --> 01:18:45.083
<i>Eternal rest</i>

376
01:18:45.166 --> 01:18:48.791
<i>Grant unto him, O Lord</i>

377
01:18:48.875 --> 01:18:52.958
<i>And let perpetual light</i>

378
01:18:53.041 --> 01:18:56.750
<i>Shine upon him</i>

379
01:19:00.458 --> 01:19:03.500
Heavenly Father, who art the li...

380
01:20:19.625 --> 01:20:22.250
Jesus Christ!

381
01:24:13.666 --> 01:24:20.666
HELLHOLE

382
01:29:09.291 --> 01:29:13.125
Subtitle translation by:
Tatiana Grzegorzewska
